">Compacts and Conspiracies Vol 2</div> </div> </div> </div>As neat as that was, I'd probably rather have the information more explicitly written out in the core book, and have a new Horror Recognition Guide. Of course it's entirely possible both are on the table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T19:43:23-08:00","id":1191813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1191807#post1191807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As neat as that was, I'd probably rather have the information more explicitly written out in the core book, and have a new Horror Recognition Guide. Of course it's entirely possible both are on the table.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would too... but word count. The core groups got expanded by the original C&amp;C, I would love to see some of the other groups that aren't likely be a focus in 2e core like the Ahl al-Jabal (shocking, I know), Utopia Now, Habibiti Ma, Keepers of the Weave, and the Bear Club to get the same treatment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tiny