s=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:05:38-07:00","id":1219618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1219578#post1219578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hunter the vigils a successor to Hunter's hunted, Project twilight, and ghost hunter's. not hunter the reckoning.</div> </div> </div> </div>What? Characters","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:18:39-07:00","id":1219625,"title":"","content":"saying its Project twilight and the arcanum that they should do a conversion guide to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:32:10-07:00","id":1219629,"title":"","content":"I am 100% certain it will get a Kickstarter. OPP has moved completely to that, and it seems most games will moving forward, and it makes sense. No more cutting into your profits due to the middlemen (brick and mortar stores). No more making 1,000,000 copies and only selling 500,000. You are selling directly to your consumer base, pocketing almost all of the profits. It's a win/win. We get a more tailored product, and they get more money. The question is: what are some exclusive backer tiers you'd like to see? For example...<br /> <br /> $1,000: Be the Monster. Work with the developers to create your very own Slasher to be incorporated into the rulebook.<br /> $500: Dark Master. Design a dread power to be included in the core rulebook.<br /> $300: Mastering the Nite's Rituals. You get a collector's edition leather bound copy of Hunter: the Vigil 2E.<br /> <br /> These are just some thoughts I've had about it. I'd love a tier which let's you go play a game run by the devs themselves and leave with a signed copy of the book.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:44:28-07:00","id":1219634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lukkychukky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1219629#post1219629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am 100% certain it will get a Kickstarter. OPP has moved completely to that, and it seems most games will moving forward, and it makes sense. No more cutting into your profits due to the middlemen (brick and mortar stores). No more making 1,000,000 copies and only selling 500,000. You are selling directly to your consumer base, pocketing almost all of the profits. It's a win/win. We get a more tailored product, and they get more money. The question is: what are some exclusive backer tiers you'd like to see? For example...<br /> <br /> $1,000: Be the Monster. Work with the developers to create your very own Slasher to be incorporated into the rulebook.<br /> $500: Dark Master. Design a dread power to be included in the core rulebook.<br /> $300: Mastering the Nite's Rituals. You get a collector's edition leather bound copy of Hunter: the Vigil 2E.<br /> <br /> These are just some thoughts I've had about it. I'd love a tier which let's you go play a game run by the devs themselves and leave with a signed copy of the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be surprised if those where the high end tiers. Pretty much the only Kickstarters where content gets added to the manuscript is Dark Eras. Otherwise it delays the release of the book too much. I expect they will be the same as Changeling 2e:<ul><li>$400: You become an art model</li> <li>$600: Creative designs a Slasher for your chronicle in an upcoming book (read: not core)</li> <li>$800: Consulting developer</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:49:41-07:00","id":1219638,"title":"","content":"Ah, you're right. That's what I meant. Yeah, that's a large reason why EX3 got delayed as it did. And as far as those being actual rewards or not, I was just spit-balling. Those would be neat ones to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T07:51:03-07:00","id":1219639,"title":"","content":"I'd love a big book of antagonists. Collect all the other splats and give them a couple of alternative versions, like vampire masters with drone vampires, werewolves who can't control their changing, and Beasts who have built-in anathema, give me some other common monsters, like zombies, and give me a really robust toolkit to build more of whatever I want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T12:59:13-07:00","id":1219754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1219639#post1219639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd love a big book of antagonists. Collect all the other splats and give them a couple of alternative versions, like vampire masters with drone vampires, werewolves who can't control their changing, and Beasts who have built-in anathema, give me some other common monsters, like zombies, and give me a really robust toolkit to build more of whatever I want.</div> </div> </div> </div>All great ideas. To hold you over, check here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show/\">The Horror Show</a><br /> (If they could hire/enlist <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar775_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"775\" data-vbnamecard=\"775\">Reighnhell</a> and/or <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3279_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3279\" data-vbnamecard=\"3279\">Pale_Crusader</a>, for said book, it would be ideal.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-06T08:23:14-07:00","id":1232865,"title":"","content":"Since the Geist KS just started and is doing fairly well thus far, we can hope that Hunter will be on deck sometime in the near future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Raymond &quot;Fen&quot; Sempek</b><br /> Just here to back Kickstarters, and drink all of your Monster.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13328-shinxfenris","name":"ShinXFenris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13328_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T05:02:35-07:00","id":1233950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShinXFenris</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1232865#post1232865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the Geist KS just started and is doing fairly well thus far, we can hope that Hunter will be on deck sometime in the near future.</div> </div> </div> </div>So... None of this is official, but after our episode with James Bell, he may or may not have intimated that Hunter could very well be coming up very soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T08:13:15-07:00","id":1234002,"title":"","content":"It seems insanely probable that Hunter will be the next CofD Kickstarter. Mummy is the only other 1e original that isn't updated yet, and it's clearly not ready, and Deviant is the next new game and isn't as far along as Hunter is.<br /> <br /> That said, I would be surprised if it's the next Onyx Path Kickstarter, because Rich tends to try to vary them between the different core systems/etc. Given the look of the current schedule, I'd assume Dystopia Rising or They Came from Beneath the Sea! will be next, with Hunter after.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T10:05:02-07:00","id":1234035,"title":"","content":"I'm just wondering since I can't find the &quot;ask anything&quot; thread. Is the hunt club meant to be playable since it's introduced as a cabal with compact rules system? Like fight monsters as them, not just humans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T12:07:11-07:00","id":1234066,"title":"","content":"Yes, I believe the Hunt Club is meant to be playable. Even Slashers are meant to be playable to some extent. Go nuts.<br /> Semi-Edit: Even if they arn't, don't let that stop you if you feel like it :V","signature":"","edited":{"userid":18090,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","user":"Ruger","date":". 07-11-2018, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T14:43:33-07:00","id":1234092,"title":"","content":"Thanks Ruger. Lastly, im just now getting the slasher book, and are slashers meant to have a theme like prometheans becoming human and vampires trying to keep their humanity, and are they meant to kill just people or both people and monsters","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T17:00:00-07:00","id":1234113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1234092#post1234092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks Ruger. Lastly, im just now getting the slasher book, and are slashers meant to have a theme like prometheans becoming human and vampires trying to keep their humanity, and are they meant to kill just people or both people and monsters</div> </div> </div> </div>Well their theme is &quot;Slasher Movie badguy&quot;, individuals can have their own goals, purpose, etc but as a group their theme is &quot;putting bodies in the ground&quot;. Most of the early stage Slashers can choose their preferred targets, and since Hunters have a higher chance of becoming Slashers it is certainly plausible for those targets to be supernatural in nature. An Avenger could go around only killing Vampires, though there is a major risk that he would quickly expand to killing people or become a much-less-picky Legend. You could also come up with excuses for some of the others, such as letting Chiron have a Brute on a metaphorical and/or literal leash that they let out for special occasions, or a Charmer infiltrating a Hunter group to eventually cut everyone up. All budding Slashers who are ex-hunter also theoretically focus on the supernatural, at least until they go full-crazy. Most still tend go on some kind of Vigil afterwords, and there is a few words noting that they can be dangerous allies to hunters.<br /> <br /> In the end, some just kill people. Some kill people and monsters, especially the ex-hunters. It is possible to have one that only kills monsters, though that situation is rare and can change easily.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T17:12:38-07:00","id":1234114,"title":"","content":"Ahh ok, thanks for taking the time to answer","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T04:18:58-07:00","id":1234241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1234092#post1234092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks Ruger. Lastly, im just now getting the slasher book, and are slashers meant to have a theme like prometheans becoming human and vampires trying to keep their humanity, and are they meant to kill just people or both people and monsters</div> </div> </div> </div>I also think the answer is yes to both. They can kill people, and they can kill monsters. But they are the main antagonists facing Hunter cells, so it seems like they'd more likely go after people, IMO. They are the quintessential Slasher Movie Killers. Dropping guys and gals like a nervous outfielder dropping pop flies in his debut game. So, I don't think they're meant so much to have a theme as opposed to being what opposes a Hunter cell. But that's just my 2 cents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T07:33:41-07:00","id":1234287,"title":"","content":"Ok, i think I understand. Is it a good way to play as a slasher as a hunter losing his morality, but not quite into human murder spree yet","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T13:20:35-07:00","id":1234379,"title":"","content":"In what sense are we talking &quot;play&quot; here?<br /> <br /> Though in general, someone isn't a Slasher until they've lost their morality. A fresh Slasher that started as a hunter has already stopped caring about the value of human life and will kill people if it suits them; they just might not have discovered that it suits them yet. It seems like you're more interested in a character that's not a Slasher yet, but on the tipping point and something like killing a few normal humans to get to a monster is going to shove them off the edge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T21:03:29-07:00","id":1234520,"title":"","content":"What you said is basically perfect. I'm also wondering how long I can play as a fully embraced slasher (as in having an undertaking) before moving along with a new character to take down my original hunter who's now a slasher","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T21:06:40-07:00","id":1234524,"title":"","content":"There's not much in the way of progress or growth for slashers. And given that their prey is usually humans even the challenge is pretty diminished.<br /> <br /> I think you could play a long time as one, but it would be hard not to get bored unless the ST was really good with antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-13-2018, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T22:33:08-07:00","id":1234542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1191605-is-hunter-going-to-get-a-kickstarter?p=1234524#post1234524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's not much in the way of progress or growth for slashers. And given that their prey is usually humans even the challenge is pretty diminished.<br /> <br /> I think you could play a long time as one, but it would be hard not to get bored unless the ST was really good with antagonists.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could always play a Dexter, have some Slasher on Slasher action.<br /> <br /> In the end, the rules and lore are meant to facilitate stories, not stifle them. Play however you think would be fun, there is no reason you can't blatantly ignore the book if you think it would get in the ways of your ideas if everyone at the table is fine with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-13T04:29:57-07:00","id":1234583,"title":"","content":"While Ruger makes some very solid points, I kind of lean towards nofather here. I agree that the system isn't meant to prevent good stories, or even bar a player from playing a Slasher chronicle as the Slasher. But, I feel like this would wok best in more of a one-shot scenario, you know? Or little spurts here and there. A sustained, long-running Slasher Chronicle - to me - seems like it could get old real fast. But, I freaking LOVE the idea of pitting a Hunter cell against a Slasher/s as the main antagonist/s of a long-running chronicle!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T20:01:19-08:00","id":1275008,"title":"","content":"As of today, their are art notes on the KS art being prepped. So the answer is a definite yes!","signature":"<hr class